    "Landlock scoped write control when available",
    "seccomp default-kill network denial",
    "seccomp writable-open denial in Landlock fallback",
    "bounded raw output capture and sanitized receipt text",
    "durable pending/effected/committed/failed/ambiguous receipts",
    "idempotency, conflict, revocation, replay, and corruption fail-closed semantics"
  ],
